ounty&rsquo;s 6 grids in Kearney County came in under 90% of normal for November to December in 41 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value ran 37% of normal for March to April and 26% of normal for November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 16% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 24725 had its driest year in 1974 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
